 sandwich.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"¿Qué comes?","english":"What do you eat?","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Ella come una ensalada.","english":"She eats a salad.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Comemos en el café.","english":"We eat at the café.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Quiero un café.","english":"I would like a coffee.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"¿Qué quieres?","english":"What would you like?","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Ella quiere un té.","english":"She would like a tea.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Queremos dos sándwiches.","english":"We would like two sandwiches.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Quiero un café, por favor.","english":"I would like a coffee, please.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Quiero un té y un sándwich.","english":"I would like a tea and a sandwich.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Un café y una ensalada, por favor.","english":"A coffee and a salad, please.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Buenas tardes. ¿Qué quiere?","english":"Good afternoon. What would you like?","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Quiero un café y un sándwich, por favor.","english":"I would like a coffee and a sandwich, please.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"¿Algo más?","english":"Anything else?","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"No, gracias. Eso es todo.","english":"No, thank you. That's all.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Voy al mercado.","english":"I go to the market.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Estoy en el mercado.","english":"I am at the market.","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"¿Adónde vas?","english":"Where are you going?","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"¿Dónde estás?","english":"Where are you?","level":"A1","source":"grammar"},{"spanish":"Voy al mercado.","english":"I go to the market.","level":"A1"